  "ctr_craft_note": "The fluffy Power Palm fronds, in the manner of the Better Leaves resource pack: a plain cube (group base) and crossed planes that stick out of it (two per variant: v1a + v1b, v2a + v2b ...). The block state picks one of the four variants and a turn at random. Texture slot 'all' is the fronds' picture."
}